sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Developer or automation
    participant GH as GitHub emulator
    participant Shim as Fullsend workflow shim
    participant Dispatch as Reusable dispatch workflow
    participant Runner as Actions runner
    participant OIDC as Local OIDC broker
    participant Mint as Fullsend Mint
    participant Shell as OpenShell gateway
    participant Agent as Agent sandbox
    participant Telemetry as MLflow / Observatory

    User->>GH: Issue, PR, comment, or review event
    GH->>GH: Match trigger and create workflow run
    GH->>Shim: Start fullsend workflow with event payload
    Shim->>Dispatch: workflow_call(event_action, payload, mint_url)
    Dispatch->>GH: Queue triage, code, review, or fix job
    Runner->>GH: Poll and claim queued job
    GH-->>Runner: Job steps, event payload, and Actions environment
    Runner->>OIDC: Request OIDC assertion
    OIDC-->>Runner: Development OIDC assertion
    Runner->>Mint: POST /v1/token(role, repos) with assertion
    Mint-->>Runner: Scoped role token
    Runner->>GH: Checkout target repository with scoped token
    Runner->>Shell: Start OpenShell agent execution
    Shell->>Agent: Create policy-constrained sandbox
    Agent->>GH: Read repository and write allowed updates
    Agent->>Telemetry: Optional traces and artifacts
    Agent-->>Shell: Agent result and artifacts
    Shell-->>Runner: Execution result
    Runner->>GH: Upload logs and complete job
    GH-->>Shim: Complete workflow run
